{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1370,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5015bf33d2a7701de7495188",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是最强的开运装备！\r\n不怕任何厄运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "348711070c2fa3639ecc6159191fcf2fdbfeefd62978561d8a0fd0376ba92e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c055f44468202fd6d2ce31aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，开运的气势很耀眼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "309ad723a428d732ca227392601afd5b4cea1d56b63a5c4b3f72e29dd1c0c53d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:182a552d9225a2d3c59f3111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是「大吉」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f06acde87fd5dd75b1b77b28835194b2022efd8e081d0c8844ad606117bcdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c875c9c08fe9e87d88397ae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开运力量全开！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24f7247877a3e886940a54e4e862828352d846eb36af62e690ffb78aee6646d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba25816765c89e10c98a612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79c32a4e7126b13a2236e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "開運パワー、全開ですよっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eac683059b7b08cd8825971f9b0d7f495d7f2c5d591795b5b849f7e3b8c832cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab7070df1cd1e86efb4ec63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼……以为能\r\n赢过有神灵附体的我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0681bd2353ede39c2d58cf7a4d88a1617d9aa7e0cc41b4aca9b2b33e0525c5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f3235d0f9e8af57a6d0b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这还只是刚开始……！\r\n下次一定会让大家\r\n败在水晶球之下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "122654102d57ca340025ba2a7f029a0faf00b15200f888ffe02c114f4a95935d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e3232cbb52d2dd88b5aca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！打招呼顺便帮你\r\n占卜一下今天的运势吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df869537a38fb3a77cff488877f7687a6edc04c1ea7e730f703bbf148b43a436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74b0f471a08acc39cf1dca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是因为我早上有把\r\n水晶球擦亮的关系吗？\r\n心情觉得特别爽快呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18bce5ef88ea562886a3107393fff7be72dde46466baeeb73a1eb3343e30f4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c6ee24bf2642e446cb0a0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了提升今天训练的能力，\r\n吃完午餐后就先去一趟神社吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdb922b46ece7d3c506ff1316b77f2e253c6dc336ea6218eba2e8a562507a4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b475718df7698d143eca2a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和我一起吃午餐吗？\r\n我还可以顺便帮你占卜\r\n今天的幸运食物是什么哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "265858698883e43ce5f5ee433856b587c24a31fd83ae9243838737e23f260e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d536d0b854fc2480e0b1beed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我建议在枕头下面放三颗糖果哦。\r\n这样会让运气稍～\r\n微变比较好的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d16505cb35df8777cea82d3aaa79888d4d188d3015a7158fcfcbeeb02014b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8db473491df17e19de9ce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辣、辣的东西我不太敢吃……\r\n但现在吃辣好像对风水有好影响……\r\n那我就拼上性命去尝试了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0261c2d6d51d6458bbb7d4da377c45fa4909546ee882263b0e25ecaa2e3e41cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01d65c57c47ced87abb72c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏花的时候不要铺蓝色的防水垫，\r\n改铺大布巾会比较好哦。\r\n特别是上面\r\n有蔓草花纹的那种，会提升财运哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebac412d135c52a41b40d1e5c4ea9885c6744de75a5929d65141cd7a0ff2f850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2b89771d88cc8e817b7c02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凉面、荞麦面、凉拌豆腐～！！\r\n──好啦，帮你下了\r\n可以吃到夏天美食的咒语了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "341ec7091a5b654be8b6f3c5fb316e13f487f4530960f6ab182486b07709407c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f617728861a479efa396cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼呀～！哈呀～！\r\n──结果出来了！\r\n这个秋天的幸运花是「菊花」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6bc7ff9ecef45a660dc403bed0a833c59ed9869f3b7e7b1eb83d9f34f61384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac5f6e126f7eeff185346a44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "占卜结果显示「保暖为吉」，\r\n所以我们去暖炉桌吧──\r\n真、真的啦！我没有说谎哦……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be88ee988631311d62d9c94f3bcb2bf7f7dde42cb61c45a1c55798bfd3de2a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf35291f535b066c57e53bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的花样\r\n竟然还能做花朵占卜！\r\n来占卜一下今天的运势吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8fdec3d0bd3731258c4309f7050a6a6aefaf1ce0900189811a5edfab22bc3c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c0a51e162cae1e711aa47e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天的起点就要从积极的咒语开始！\r\n大吉～超吉～狐狐吉～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "688db0d3850c601f578003c753ee068e8b807b7219ecb38f99fa1aec9f6afebe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4029967e3529b6f355d3228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～肚子一直咕噜咕噜叫……！\r\n这难道就是要我吃\r\n特大胡萝卜汉堡排的征兆！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e0cd2c9d77f25ea74771ef9fdb3bdeaa57d99d3e584e6a77c80b21fb9dcf13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33aadaf834a32a3d95a0eefb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了幸运饼干哦！\r\n当作点心来吃吃看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26678c3a2cec57399dfb5b8cbea901b3a0a7d5a23e919c17cb6196cb7b34f8ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dac85e0443fdc999abcfebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到占卜就会想到星星！\r\n要不要一起观测星象，\r\n来找我们的幸运星呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec000f167badb149ea3f12486d24582a1d4ae47a88bc41c5f1224d9e0d6437c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be97cc4ecb73b939d5bc38c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……为了看到茶柱，\r\n一不小心喝了太多绿茶……！\r\n结果害我都睡不着了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9041f4517f629cc94dd744ee47deb9fa05ee4623e48674820809d484e77d467f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f116cfce821bf7c682282a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯──每次呼吸，\r\n都会感觉有力量灌入身体里～！\r\n嘶──呼──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff001ca735953c9214ea4546d0e445661bf09a29811a39bd0c00aa2dac4eaf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85d7e3dee4a2a0ecbf0f660",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风铃的声音是可以驱邪的！\r\n我买了二十个左右回来呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20aa97865068ad41b85f26495bcf406cd5e71aee814fed8bd1b6f3831585294f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b43731b5bec98a988f1d3e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毒蝇伞是幸运的前兆！\r\n采香菇的时候一定要注意哦！\r\n……虽然它不能吃就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c943fcb837112e6de3143e72f870f6972436b3080a9d2da24e9e0e7912215700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd188765bed77d556a83b02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒冷是会妨碍运气提升的！\r\n这时候就要靠火锅热滚滚的力量，\r\n来获得温暖！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f369e9d11ce94aefd4f78b7adf72692b0edbce3a6498cac7e88394f04f1c74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2804c433447ff2d7eea5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "HAPPY情人节快乐！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f2fe2872656e1d204a7ec1a35fdca021a5363a5ee346f038e87cfc89f0c0190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47dfee63fb76d950e2b86641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "HAPPY情人节快乐！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f2fe2872656e1d204a7ec1a35fdca021a5363a5ee346f038e87cfc89f0c0190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1b164c748baa26cc8b644c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "消灾解厄全都交给我吧！\r\n我好歹也是家里经营神社的。\r\n只是我做的……全都是自创的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "390e978149c08627c207db2a79dc9eca145837830e14edadde949b298a007d07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d5decee3e258e984e92a81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看铃鹿同学好像有点落寞的样子，\r\n就送了她一个大型鲷的摆饰！\r\n那可是保佑幸运的东西呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94b63b75334d60cdcd56f72e74f996bb8463adb16a209b3206c46037561c9af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cae682f0c15eb39a4120bcac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想告诉大树同学她今天运势大吉，\r\n但英文要怎么说啊？\r\nExtreme Happy？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60b897f5a16bdaaa5ae2d67741caa0246e868dda3b170a60626d486ca0e03fd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2e4ad495368967064ffda3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员今天的运势是……\r\n晴时多云！！根据情况还有发生\r\n大雨般好运的可能哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd435a18d02b99697452a284a1bfb553865d89cd623c2474cf58a98550ebc424",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbd7ccbe00fe34f9266c0e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽同学对我说「你很努力嘛」……\r\n我因为太感动，就把\r\n狸猫的信乐烧送给她了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bfd1716539a3a4388ab37c63db3dd75f84aafd20de13c855780776232ddaf81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4bb00d30bed03b5263be936",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我在家里跳神乐舞的时候\r\n常常跌倒……Live上\r\n我会小心不要波及别人的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6464fb2893698d939fee20966963a4db6fa28a03b33d6435d024e6d474bada47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d680e741064c4b882e5627",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巫女的白衣、绯色和服褶裙与千早，\r\n这种飘逸的衣服我都穿习惯了！\r\n虽然我每次都会踩到自己的裤摆……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8bb81ec71a09cd1e48b38067c32318fe8f422b19f78b0b56bc45c02ba532e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baae64b54e6df4b8155484db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来就会提升运气的决胜服，\r\n……满溢而出的神灵力量！\r\n只要穿上这个……我一定也可以！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b89ab27f5fe3ee31358c7c616d855c633176de7ec65406f3a6b3b2bc81c6100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8bfd4f7e6e649330ddeaff3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！\r\n还有能够招福的「喵桑」陪我呢！\r\n我会带着信心去跑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b587658043304de7382214d0b1ea6a5c21567bc6e80c1acef8aab36774000235",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc909ba676a259939abddf40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，Shiraoki大人的神谕……！\r\n嗯嗯，今天──\r\n我会吃到混在玉子烧里的蛋壳！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f25c597425e68d2a9942eea847a8e2dacc515908ceda4a6c7397b4f0e2b0a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a80dbf09a231fdfb730f217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员你听我说……！\r\n刚刚立了三根茶柱，然后……\r\n三根都……全沉下去了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b5983ae815e42c6f2275d232942c3a4343f375ccea824e1aae8c4e5baff8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0823c11f0e43965ec7a5f77e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呵呵──作业写的很顺利呢～♪\r\n这都是因为我有开运转转铅笔\r\n这个好搭档的关系！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6527519fdd770109e4f1ce1ab42599a8884019587b7281083346dfaf175f8316",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0c1eaa77d673b2702be352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到在春天苏醒的幸运象征……\r\n对了，瓢虫！来吧来吧，\r\n一起去找吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce2ac26c9598780c6358e7020a1704a74d8ac8557a1acf250c80ef8c33de94c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b651d37378128655ad3b6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是樱桃很好吃的季节呢。\r\n不只好吃，还可以用樱桃籽占卜，\r\n……可以说是充满幸福的食物啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08241a0877d0da3ef3f6f25494bf1ce844f27a046fcd1f6997ed9b907d544a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1cd6b04be40730ab7c4ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很推荐秋天时做四国巡礼哦～！\r\n还可以享受到红叶及美食，\r\n可说是一石三鸟啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bf965fe7b5623cfacf3ad179badd40dcbaeeeb9611dbb1d0feb24515976e32b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d87e2ee5c16f63ff410e69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是皮肤很容易干燥的那种，\r\n干脆涂上金粉，不只看起来喜庆，\r\n说不定还能改善干燥问题……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eccc70c963e1b026b1bf630665ce158e462e6dbc9d2d5ba6bebbc9bd7acaf37a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81f1e7b7feb4567a6d799052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个装御朱印用的小包包\r\n是我自己做的哦～！\r\n上面的鸟画得很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1ab2fb92e802fcef7281b623a42f1d13e45b1adedf7f2541f73bd415618d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41421466aeba6769497c72af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最适合训练员的护身符……\r\n嗯～特地要想就很难想到呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bee5706d8072f60367409d72d79a8e86c7e73eb2dc39990e3750b22ec5e822b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a2530dba2c124c5809419c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怒涛因为打结的线手忙脚乱的……\r\n所以，我就给了她一个\r\n可以立刻解开结的护身符哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b74e903062683e24034e6e2c958f35a2d019c3b66685bfe8c71a100e04ad6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf26697369e5840017d25fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天空真的很受猫咪喜欢耶……\r\n她本身也很像猫的感觉……\r\n该不会她其实是招财猫的化身！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd1bca2836cf130b0fe05caf7480b7dada2554acfe28a71128064d7a271a815",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7b02e5363e4cfee331eafd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树约我一起出门。\r\n一起去能量景点加野餐好像不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a4d8bda5239116508485a99ab941a62e3bf922715a41d79b182c2515931779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d6922e124ea703bc263f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找早上的幸运蜘蛛的时候，\r\n不小心就把蜘蛛网给弄坏了……\r\n请原谅我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd69a27a461720fe2288c16a818eb8d7930e64d3c744bfa84dc1031ec82f576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77a4e65fd786388e8fc3276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次都会用午餐甜点的糖浆，\r\n在甜点上淋出大吉的字哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36f0feb120035d74dff08e7ed35c88fd0792f7db20974c30b8f032beb526736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8017b2ed09b53dc7381fdd75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论当下心情有多好，\r\n都不可以在晚上的时候吹口哨哦。\r\n不能像这样「咻──」地……啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92985541f292a3572991a75aee30aedeffed6d3812ac66be4c64ec5e0b0b3116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514b0cf86868605e35db6cf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赏花的话，去神社好像不错呢！\r\n我会带春季幸运便当去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "362498f0eda10b64064571a096c88b231be6948e719a48374d5e4d2b40f00e24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1569adab21e1cebd613902aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到烟火在空中绽放，不好的运气\r\n也会烟消云散！所以，可以的话……\r\n我想和你一起去夏日祭典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f7dca56f0ab945ace39dd1fa67280029003fd258fcea55f038b7a0d76d4fce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a9ce71f7a718fa9045462b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天是阴阳转换的时期！\r\n应该也要来更换一下\r\n护身符的组合呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ffedbef5747730dbb413c7213bc609175a519e9862305d5e6af796c1f21a56f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acf273e60bcefc7304a10836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……训练员的围巾\r\n看起来好保暖……感觉一直有\r\n温暖的能量传来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab43cf2d4ee6ae3c75385adce4881736ec803ce27b368b23c93f3374c1c3b50c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cb60703180c5935d58de72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，有了这套衣服，\r\n我就不需要再找四叶幸运草了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab50d137fe23b2d24aaec2ea4f54933c4e7675cdcc8ddf93ff4c25416f12059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f709801da5db60bb41651943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是最强的开运服！\r\n训练员也想要的话，\r\n我可以帮你做开运搭配哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f20b36333f6421ca830ea08c4157b7ed6cd24f7f589178e871742afb3f6578",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f949ee7957789871c1b8596b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备工作跟占卜都已经做好了哦。\r\n那我们今天也开始进行训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "300dc7ba95ed8fe9f8f900473936fa9b60150f655a680fb09ec00b0af02a2f45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77c3da05b1358f8799a426f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5e6d959ef5a2ccf43b16b72ce85e81a5fd39253a4426d3654a7e5ee57b5150",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2883834affc3507e50d046a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来占卜看看在哪里\r\n训练会比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68e78332aee7d53ffc4e82caa2031a9653747d29fd7093ac2196c2edcde92a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b68a689770ae5657cc0f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……！身体充满了神灵力量啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "297d683343eb0d5e4bc0b126370c5bf2cd7d5445c420f7d8ed58156b26cdad95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154c2f9800b7970fab887038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了抓住福气，\r\n今天也要跟平常一样做开运冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9aad85e7ea1e842c80ab0f910a3af75b2ee8202eaab78bc85fd618b419c82d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860dccfe93010b4c42e4a25d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就照Shiraoki大人的神谕，\r\n去尽情地奔跑吧！\r\n这样一定能开启通往未来的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a1a803f6a7c95298ede815a438da5953ea094e86689e048d32583f98955e31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f26c07807bb3815f72e4fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你一直支持\r\n老是依赖占卜的我……！\r\n我会努力达到你的期望的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e7b679266dcbdde9f5f8ab5688d422951cfff877a6f5d3aad25cc1cad1212d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5483f0b4098ac13cd49073d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我完全信任占卜结果跟训练员！\r\n因为你是我命中注定的人啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51ea0c4d1fef29a6c04b721d47483c8141231de6a594b224c34bcd600b43c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:669706bf1498db394e68389f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦的训练项目也尽管来吧。\r\n我准备了无论怎么跑\r\n都不会肌肉酸痛的护身符！",
      "source_fingerprint": "357367ee4901b06ce67e74fb5f403887c0faadb6a184ee8dc9b82419462328c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd42d572b4c445b5eb9921f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相信运气会带来成果！\r\n今天也要好好地努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcbd638daa9f00e267d71008cdca6754cb24434030bea122a85e38cc0168076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e087f841d9d4bbea3d1e1053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要从全身的开运道具补充能量！\r\n耶～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "517b2875a98d401cd15a8f682f03ce64c12f9ab34ad20f3ea544b493c6c2f7de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f455396d0bb79196517a769e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有预感你差不多就要来找我了！\r\n这都是开运装备的功劳呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8fb9bde120f209dead183f9ce28925ec4f644365bd53fc68f6ed7fd6a1dddb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ab42192b084462b8b0f088",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在葫芦里面装了运动饮料！\r\n已经彻底准备完成了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "737ff4f4576241d4f8e06b201f8084f5832648deea417c41447d5001ce03587e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90f1244371a5c777c9acb410",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "众多开运道具的能量，\r\n再加上训练员的加持……\r\n简直就是如虎添翼了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22bb134929344fb309ce08c5f3b093c98a3af1edf84a26e4b68d5f129111547a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef2bd70db1b2bb3df5631ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要把一直以来累积的幸运能量，\r\n全部都用在大舞台上！\r\n开花爷爷训练员请引领我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3d585c76895bc87a81716a3748ac9b7e7e193f07aab10850ffbca1b3d50df7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b3f44587d6aaa7ea2c7ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员累积很多回忆的话……！\r\n那些回忆，一定会成为神奇的力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "228878437b264e64e06023d199a04c1b5ca0ee92dd7d36e2d40522ff13b7a736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3585d659221eb3e63cc8c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然训练员就是我命中注定的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "848fbea32f125d8a6b8d945c2262ff631005b19fa0d981fa698adad16b539e3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af43f209f046eaf9681c7904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后我们也要一起抓住福气哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9a66ee07aa46d775e0765e3d3916e2fec5c0b4f0c6be8699e6d28883c119e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f61136a29eec2edf5a700c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从很久以前就怀抱的梦想……\r\n是你让它开花结果的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6c4ae42c5e3ddef80f17b929cd6c4d8355713958ecd065ebb3a3df9593c20e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614f8bef8ea0cf5047a78726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起走过了\r\n充满幸运及快乐的旅程呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cce4c976cddc13995a8bc2ce11f1f05d5d4ca20a7af47c24cac9d380010fedbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
